msgid "settings.autoFetch.hint"
msgstr "When viewing one repository, gitwink quietly runs git fetch origin as the panel opens so a teammate's newly pushed commit appears. It only updates the remote-tracking mirror—never local branches, tags, or the working tree. It never blocks the panel, stays silent when authentication or the network is unavailable, and skips recently fetched repositories. The all-repositories view never fetches. gitwink never merges, pushes, or rewrites your work."

